{
    "title": "Key Collector Comics",
    "description": "Key Collector Comics: Unlock the Full Spectrum of Comic Books - Specializing in Key Issues!\r\n\r\nYour Ultimate Guide to the Comic Universe \u2013 Key and Beyond\r\nKey Collector Comics isn't just about \"Key\" comic books; it's a treasure trove for all comic enthusiasts. While we specialize in identifying and cataloging key issues \u2013 those pivotal comics that mark first appearances, iconic cover arts, and crucial storylines \u2013 our app also offers an expansive database encompassing the entire spectrum of comic books.\r\n\r\nWhy Key Collector Comics Stands Out\r\n\r\n\u2022 Specialized in Key Comics: Unmatched expertise in flagging key issues that define characters and shape comic lore.\r\n\u2022 A Universe of Comics: Access an all-inclusive database, featuring both key and non-key comic books.\r\n\u2022 Complimentary Collection Management: Organize and manage your entire comic collection, key or not, at absolutely no cost.\r\n\u2022 Instant Discovery: Spot valuable and interesting comics in any collection at a glance.\r\n\u2022 Simplified Pricing Guide: Quick, ungraded book pricing for informed buying and selling.\r\n\u2022 Personal Cataloging: Track your key issue ownership and curate a wishlist for future acquisitions.\r\n\r\nEndorsed by the Greats, Loved by Fans\r\n\r\n\u2022 Celebrated and recommended by comic icons like Alex Ross and Neal Adams.\r\n\u2022 Exclusive giveaways and fan engagement within the app.\r\n\u2022 A pristine, ad-free experience focused solely on your comic passion.\r\n\r\nElevate Your Comic Experience with Key Collector Premium\r\n\r\n\u2022 Real-Time Key Issue Alerts: Never miss an update on key comics.\r\n\u2022 Innovative Cover Image Search: Identify comics effortlessly.\r\n\u2022 Hot Keys & Hidden Gems: Explore trending issues and rare finds.\r\n\u2022 Daily Curated Content: Stay updated with fresh, daily comic insights.\r\n\r\nDive into the world of comics with an app that's passionate about key issues and reverent to the entire comic book universe. Whether you're a key issue hunter or a broad-scale collector, Key Collector Comics is your essential companion. Download now and start a new chapter in your comic collecting journey!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Subscriptions which offer additional features beyond the free set of features are available on a monthly or yearly basis.\r\n\u2022  Subscriptions provide access to Key Alert Push Notifications, Hot Keys, Dollar Bin Diver and other curated content that is updated on a daily basis.\r\n\u2022 Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase\r\n\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period\r\n\u2022 Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal\r\n\u2022 Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase\r\n\u2022 Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable\r\n\r\nhttps://www.keycollectorcomics.com/privacy\r\nhttps://www.keycollectorcomics.com/terms",
